msgstr "Deaktiviert"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:495
msgid "Supersampling"
msgstr "Supersampling"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:495
msgid ""
"Reduce flicker for high contrast edges. Useful when the input resolution is "
"high compared to the headset display."
msgstr ""
"Reduziert Flackern an kontrastreichen Kanten. Nützlich, wenn die "
"Eingangsauflösung hoch im Vergleich zum Headset-Display ist."

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:496
msgid "Sharpening"
msgstr "Bildschärfung"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:496
msgid ""
"Improve clarity of high contrast edges and counteract blur. Useful when the "
"input resolution is low compared to the headset display."
msgstr ""
"Verbessert die Klarheit kontrastreicher Kanten und verringert Unschärfe. "
"Nützlich, wenn die Eingangsauflösung niedrig im Vergleich zum Headset-"
"Display ist."

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:499
msgid "Post-processing"
msgstr "Post-Processing"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:499
msgctxt "page header subtitle"
msgid "OpenXR layer supersampling and sharpening."
msgstr "OpenXR-Layer-Supersampling und -Schärfung."

